# ClassPlus Backend

A backend system where teachers create assignments and all students assigned to that teacher receive **real-time notifications**.

## 🏗️ System Design
              TEACHER
                 │
                 │ Create Assignment
                 ↓
          Express Controller
                 │
        ┌────────┴─────────┐
        ↓                  ↓
    MongoDB             BullMQ
   Assignment             │
     saved                ↓
                   Redis Queue
              assignment-notification
                           │
                           ↓
                        Worker
                           │
                           ↓
                  Find students in DB
                           │
                           ↓
                  Create notifications
                      in MongoDB
                           │
                           ↓
                    Redis Pub/Sub
                           │
                           ↓
                      Subscriber
                           │
                           ↓
                       Socket.IO
                           │
             ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
             ↓             ↓             ↓
        student:S1    student:S2    student:S3
             │             │             │
             ↓             ↓             ↓
          Student       Student       Student

### Flow

```text
Create Assignment
       ↓
Save in MongoDB
       ↓
Add BullMQ Job
       ↓
Worker processes job
       ↓
Create notifications
       ↓
Publish through Redis
       ↓
Socket.IO
       ↓
Student receives notification
```

## 🔌 API Routes

### Create Teacher

```http
POST /api/users/teacher
```

### Create Student

```http
POST /api/users/student
```

### Assign Student to Teacher

```http
POST /api/users/assign-student
```

### Create Assignment

```http
POST /api/assignments
```

Example:

```json
{
  "teacherId": "TEACHER_ID",
  "title": "Operating Systems Assignment",
  "description": "Explain process scheduling",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-25"
}
```

---

## 🔔 Socket.IO

Students join their own room:

```text
student:<studentId>
```

Notification event:

```text
new-assignment
```

---

## ⚙️ Setup

### 1. Install

```bash
npm install
```

### 2. Create `.env`

```env
PORT=5000
MONGO_URI=your_mongodb_uri
REDIS_HOST=redis
REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379
```

### 3. Run with Docker

```bash
docker compose up --build
```

### 4. Run without Docker

Start API:

```bash
node server.js
```

Start worker:

```bash
node bullmq/notification.worker.js
```

---

## Docker

Docker Compose runs:

```text
API
Worker
Redis
```

MongoDB can be hosted using **MongoDB Atlas**.

---

## Main Concepts

```text
BullMQ      → Background jobs
Redis       → Queue + Pub/Sub
Worker      → Processes notifications
Pub/Sub     → Sends notification events
Socket.IO   → Real-time delivery
MongoDB     → Persistent data
Docker      → Containerization
```
